WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.753 --> 00:00:16.075
morning the diner was even busier than usual.

2
00:00:21.059 --> 00:00:21.600
Ally thought.

3
00:00:23.201 --> 00:00:26.384
A whole busload of museum visitors had stopped for breakfast.

4
00:00:26.924 --> 00:00:30.928
Then Ray went home to change for his meeting with the Big City Foods CEO.

5
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:36.021
So Flo helped Randy in the kitchen, leaving Ally serving all the tables on her own.

6
00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:40.383
Finally the last few customers left.

7
00:00:40.403 --> 00:00:43.244
"I've been so busy," Ally thought.

8
00:00:43.264 --> 00:00:46.424
"I forgot to listen for a chiming sound from Alpha.

9
00:00:46.945 --> 00:00:49.945
I'd better go and check on her before the lunch crowd arrives."

10
00:00:50.866 --> 00:00:55.147
But just as Ally headed for the office, two men in suits entered the diner.

11
00:00:57.628 --> 00:01:01.534
With a sigh, Ally grabbed two menus and went to greet the customers.

12
00:01:01.554 --> 00:01:05.276
"Hello, would you like a Ally stopped.

13
00:01:06.496 --> 00:01:07.697
One of the men was Ray!

14
00:01:08.998 --> 00:01:10.719
She hadn't recognized him in the suit!

15
00:01:10.739 --> 00:01:13.360
"Hello, Ally," Ray said.

16
00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:15.161
"I'd like you to meet Mr.

17
00:01:15.221 --> 00:01:16.422
Owens from Big City Foods."

18
00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:19.203
"Nice to meet you, sir," Ally said.

19
00:01:19.223 --> 00:01:24.106
"Ally is one of our best servers," Ray said, leading Mr.

20
00:01:24.186 --> 00:01:25.106
Owens to a booth.

21
00:01:25.126 --> 00:01:27.628
"Thanks, Ray," Ally said.

22
00:01:28.108 --> 00:01:29.749
"I'll be right back with your lunch."

23
00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:32.691
Ally quickly served Ray and Mr.

24
00:01:32.771 --> 00:01:35.593
Owens the special meal that Ray had prepared for their meeting.

25
00:01:36.974 --> 00:01:38.796
Then she rushed back to the office.

26
00:01:38.816 --> 00:01:40.597
"Alpha, talk to me.

27
00:01:41.357 --> 00:01:42.898
Have you been scanning customers?"

28
00:01:43.379 --> 00:01:43.939
Ally asked.

29
00:01:43.959 --> 00:01:51.464
"Affirmative. I have detected no Jorgandians or other life-forms from space, only Earthlings."

30
00:01:51.484 --> 00:01:54.727
"Well, keep working," Ally said.

31
00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.448
"Tina might come in soon.

32
00:01:57.160 --> 00:02:02.201
Remember to make a loud chime if you detect anything, so I can hear you from out in

33
00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:02.982
the dining room."

34
00:02:04.602 --> 00:02:05.702
Ally went back to work.

35
00:02:06.063 --> 00:02:08.863
As she was wiping down the counter, more customers came in.

36
00:02:08.883 --> 00:02:12.104
"There's Tina!"

37
00:02:13.085 --> 00:02:13.705
Ally gulped.

38
00:02:13.725 --> 00:02:16.125
"Be brave, Allyzooba!

39
00:02:16.606 --> 00:02:18.206
That's what your parents would say."

40
00:02:20.107 --> 00:02:23.648
Ally tried to sound relaxed, but her voice came out high and squeaky.

41
00:02:23.668 --> 00:02:25.088
"Hello, Tina."

42
00:02:27.556 --> 00:02:28.397
"Hello, Ally."

43
00:02:29.197 --> 00:02:30.378
Tina sat at the counter.

44
00:02:30.998 --> 00:02:35.500
"I hear the diner is offering a free lunch to new residents of Sandville."

45
00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.541
"Yep, yep, yep!"

46
00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:37.281
Ally said.

47
00:02:37.301 --> 00:02:39.663
"Ugh! Calm down!"

48
00:02:40.063 --> 00:02:41.204
Ally scolded herself.

49
00:02:41.224 --> 00:02:44.365
"Tina can't hurt you when there are humans around."

50
00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:49.288
"So, what can I get you, Tina?"

51
00:02:49.308 --> 00:02:52.550
"A Beta Burgana," Tina said.

52
00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:54.111
"With a side of fries."

53
00:02:54.131 --> 00:02:56.052
"Sure thing!"

54
00:02:57.968 --> 00:03:02.169
Ally gave Randy the order, then asked Flo to cover for her in the dining room for a

55
00:03:02.229 --> 00:03:05.430
second. Ally dashed into Ray's office.

56
00:03:06.511 --> 00:03:08.111
"Alpha! Did you scan Tina?"

57
00:03:08.931 --> 00:03:09.892
Alpha didn't answer.

58
00:03:09.912 --> 00:03:12.972
"Alpha, you can talk," Ally said.

59
00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:15.593
"I didn't hear you chime, but Tina is here."

60
00:03:15.613 --> 00:03:21.055
"You did not hear me chime because I have not found any Jorgandians," Alpha said.

61
00:03:21.075 --> 00:03:23.716
"What?" Ally said.

62
00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:29.214
"Whoa. Was I wrong about Tina, just like I was wrong about Melanie?"

63
00:03:31.274 --> 00:03:33.395
Ally went back into the dining room, puzzled.

64
00:03:33.415 --> 00:03:37.797
"If Tina isn't the Jorgandian, then "Ally!"

65
00:03:38.197 --> 00:03:39.218
Tina waved her over.

66
00:03:39.238 --> 00:03:41.459
"Can I talk to you?"

67
00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.621
Tina had only taken one bite out of her burger.

68
00:03:48.641 --> 00:03:50.982
"Is something wrong with your burger?"

69
00:03:51.383 --> 00:03:52.003
Ally asked.

70
00:03:53.063 --> 00:03:54.424
"No. It's delicious.

71
00:03:55.224 --> 00:03:57.825
But it reminds me of something I've had before."

72
00:03:57.845 --> 00:03:59.745
"Oh, really?"

73
00:04:00.165 --> 00:04:00.646
Ally said.

74
00:04:00.666 --> 00:04:01.626
"What's that?"

75
00:04:02.366 --> 00:04:03.606
Tina leaned in closer.

76
00:04:03.626 --> 00:04:07.187
"A burger on Beta Burgana."

77
00:04:08.288 --> 00:04:09.408
Ally's mouth fell open.

78
00:04:10.008 --> 00:04:11.068
"Alpha missed it!"

79
00:04:11.528 --> 00:04:11.969
she thought.

80
00:04:11.989 --> 00:04:15.049
"Tina is the Jorgandian!"

81
00:04:15.069 --> 00:04:17.770
"We need to talk.

82
00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.151
Now. Alone," Tina whispered.

83
00:04:20.171 --> 00:04:24.232
"Alone?" Ally looked around in a panic.

84
00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.801
"Uh I'm super busy right now.

85
00:04:27.321 --> 00:04:27.921
Right, Flo?

86
00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:29.201
I'm too busy to leave?"

87
00:04:31.182 --> 00:04:31.882
Flo shrugged.

88
00:04:31.902 --> 00:04:35.143
"It's actually pretty quiet right now.

89
00:04:35.543 --> 00:04:37.463
And Randy doesn't need help in the kitchen."

90
00:04:37.483 --> 00:04:44.385
"Unless you want to make a scene, you must come with me," Tina said.

91
00:04:44.405 --> 00:04:46.546
"And bring your computer along."

92
00:04:47.446 --> 00:04:51.227
Ally wanted to run away, but there'd be no running from a Jorgandian.

93
00:04:51.247 --> 00:04:53.768
"Fine. I'll be right back."

94
00:04:56.528 --> 00:05:01.690
Ally went into the office, unplugged Alpha, and put the machine into the wagon she and Mateo had

95
00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:02.431
used earlier.

96
00:05:03.071 --> 00:05:06.952
Her mind was whirling, but she couldn't think of a way to stop what was happening.

97
00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:10.394
"I don't want to be evaporated," Ally thought.

98
00:05:10.414 --> 00:05:12.395
"But I must be brave."

99
00:05:13.195 --> 00:05:17.237
Pulling Alpha behind her, she followed Tina outside and into an alley.

100
00:05:21.178 --> 00:05:22.939
"Please," Ally begged.

101
00:05:22.959 --> 00:05:24.800
"Don't evaporate me yet.

102
00:05:25.632 --> 00:05:27.494
My parents don't know what happened to me.

103
00:05:28.775 --> 00:05:32.918
Please give me a chance to send them a message so I can say good-bye."

104
00:05:32.938 --> 00:05:36.361
"Good-bye?" Tina blinked.

105
00:05:36.381 --> 00:05:39.684
"You've got your human words mixed up.

106
00:05:40.365 --> 00:05:41.606
Don't you mean, hello?"

107
00:05:41.626 --> 00:05:44.829
"What?" Ally was confused.

108
00:05:45.729 --> 00:05:46.490
Tina grinned.

109
00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.932
"I am Commander Tinakron.

110
00:05:49.673 --> 00:05:53.176
I was sent to Earth from Astralia to bring you back home!"
